      "message": "Hi. I\u0027m adding you as reviewers based on the file owners list. I would appreciate to get your review on this commit. It fixes an issue with the seekbar for streams with a minimal volume of 1 or higher. Currently the seekbar gets created with a minimum of 0, that leads to a bad experience because if the slider is set to 0 and the user closes and re-opens it, it automatically gets set to 1. To fix this this patch sets the minimum of the seekbar according to the minimal volume for the appropriate stream, returned from mAudioManager. I tried to keep the code close to the maximum stream value setup.",
